[
  {
    "id": "mpls_single_label_ipv4",
    "proto": "mpls",
    "summary": "冒烟：单标签栈（label 100/TTL 64）内层 IPv4/UDP 单帧；地址 ip 层、端口 mpls 层（存量等价迁移）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "mpls": {
            "src_port": 12345,
            "dst_port": 80,
            "labels": [
              {
                "label": 100
              }
            ],
            "inner_payload": "probe"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "min_packets": 1,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "eth.type",
          "value": "0x8847"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "mpls.label",
          "value": "100"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "mpls.exp",
          "value": "0"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "mpls.bottom",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "mpls.ttl",
          "value": "64"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "udp.dstport",
          "value": "80"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "data.data",
          "value": "70726f6265"
        }
      ],
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "offset": 14,
          "hex": "00 06 41 40"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "D-MPLS-1 P5 改写：count 删、顶层 mpls→层内、补 ip 层显式地址+mpls 层显式端口（原扁平缺省 10.0.0.1/20.0.0.1/12345/80 等价显式化）；fields/frames 断言保留（label entry wire: 100<<12|S<<8|TTL64=0x00064140，探针 pcap 验证值）",
        "inner_payload 显式 'probe'（9.21 显式格；data.data 紧凑 hex 首跑校准）"
      ]
    }
  },
