  {
    "id": "mpls_port_dyn",
    "proto": "mpls",
    "summary": "T-MPLS-14: mpls.src_port 动态 inc+flows=2（E1 逐流端口池）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": {
              "strategy": "inc",
              "range": [
                "10.0.1.1",
                "10.0.1.2"
              ],
              "step": 1
            },
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "mpls": {
            "src_port": {
              "strategy": "inc",
              "range": [
                30000,
                30001
              ],
              "step": 1
            },
            "dst_port": 80,
            "labels": [
              {
                "label": 100
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "group_id": {
        "strategy": "fixed",
        "value": "mpls-port-dyn"
      }
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 2,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ip.src",
          "value": "10.0.1.1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "udp.srcport",
          "value": "30000"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "ip.src",
          "value": "10.0.1.2"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "udp.srcport",
          "value": "30001"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "每流 1 帧（frames 缺省）：流1 源口 30000、流2 30001；group_id 固定单 worker FIFO（icmpv6 T-11 先例）；首跑校准"
      ]
    },
    "strategy_fc": {
      "type": "flows",
      "value": 2
    }
  }
